 ;; there. :accent is two colours from its icon, for the card's strip.
 ;; :store is where to get it: Wmark Pro's live Microsoft Store listing
 ;; (Store ID 9PMP1591Q78R, live since 2026-10-03).
 :commercial
 {:title "Commercial software"
  :lead  "Apps built on the open core, with an interface made for creators. Each has its own support page and privacy policy."
